  {
   "id": "blog05-null-trap-text-6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 149.25,
   "width": 489.44,
   "height": 105.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "blog05-null-trap-g-3"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 559266835,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1505045771,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759708800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHERE a.id IS NULL OR a.balance <> l.s\n\n계좌 6:  7.00 <> NULL  →  UNKNOWN  →  행이 걸러진다\n계좌 7:  0.00 <> NULL  →  UNKNOWN  →  걸러진다 (우연히 정상)\n\n결과: 1 · 2 · 8   ← 계좌 6 이 사라졌다",
   "originalText": "WHERE a.id IS NULL OR a.balance <> l.s\n\n계좌 6:  7.00 <> NULL  →  UNKNOWN  →  행이 걸러진다\n계좌 7:  0.00 <> NULL  →  UNKNOWN  →  걸러진다 (우연히 정상)\n\n결과: 1 · 2 · 8   ← 계좌 6 이 사라졌다",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
